  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "李杜詩",
    "sub_ename": "LI BAI AND DU FU'POETRY",
    "describe_ch": "朱熹認為「作詩先用看李杜，如士人治本經。」將李杜詩奉為詩之「經」。李白與杜甫的詩歌是後世公認唐詩頂上並峙的雙峰，韓愈說「李杜文章在，光焰萬丈長」，繼詩選及習作課程後，提供給喜歡唐詩的同學修習。",
    "describe_eh": "Zhu Xi believed that \"to write poems, first read Li and Du, just like a scholar treats the classics.\", worshiping Li and Du's poems as \"classics\" of poetry. The poems of Li Bai and Du Fu are recognized by later generations as the twin peaks standing side by side at the top of Tang poetry. Han Yu said, \"Li and Du's writings are here, as the brilliance will last forever.\" After the poetry selection and practice course, “Poems of Li Bai and Du Fu” is designed for students who like Tang poetry to study.",
